{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17572","headline":"赋得巨鱼纵大壑 · 姚康","name":"赋得巨鱼纵大壑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水府乘闲望，圆波息跃鱼。\n从来暴泥久，今日脱泉初。\n得志宁相忌，无心任宛如。\n龙门应可度，鲛室岂常居。\n掉尾方穷乐，游鳞每自舒。\n乘流千里去，风力藉吹嘘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚康","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}